This folder contains practical usage and commands of important tools:
- **nmap.md** -> Network scanning and service detection 
Basics: nmap <targets>
Advanced: nmap -sC -sV -A <targets>

-**gobuster.md** -> Directory and file bruteforcing
Example: gobuster dir -u <url> -w <wordlists>

-**wpscan.md** -> wordpress scanning and enumeration
Example: wpscan --url <url> --enumerate u

-**hydra.md** -> Brute force login attacks
Example: hydra -l <users> -P <passlists> <target> ssh




